# P90 on Windows (WinUI): zh_TW, then open the date wheel. The WinUI wheel style is a DatePicker, whose wheels are a flyout opened from its button. Positions measured 2026-10-20 with test_support/measure/measure_win.zsh: zh_TW (313,412), the first date picker (174,507) DIPs.
# Pass: the heading says zh_TW, and the open flyout orders its columns as zh_TW writes a date (year, month, day).
# P90(Windows,WinUI):選 zh_TW,再打開日期滾輪(WinUI 的滾輪是從按鈕開啟的 flyout)。通過：標題為 zh_TW,欄位順序為年、月、日。
